# ── internal verification artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────
# The harness scripts must write their temp page INTO the project root: the
# page links `css/`, `js/` and `assets/` relatively, so written into a
# subdirectory it renders blank (see the trap list at the top of
# _tools/shoot_state.py). That is why these are ignored here rather than
# tucked away in a subfolder.
_shot_page.html
_audit_page.html
_geom_page.html
_dom_dump.html
.narrow.log
_audit_run.log

# screenshots captured by _tools/shoot_all.py / _tools/narrow.py — internal
# verification only, never deliverables
.shots/

# the verification harness itself (audit.py, verify.sh, probe_*) — internal
# only; the published game is just index.html + css/ + js/ + assets/
_tools/

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
